  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loan of up to EUR 14.4 million to the Company, under the SWIFT Framework to  co-finance a EUR 239 million EU Large Infrastructure Operational Programme (&quot; LIOP&quot;) (the &quot;Project&quot;). The tenor of the loan is 15 years, including four year  grace period for Project implementation.  The project will enable Aquatim: (i) to achieve compliance with the relevant EU  standards in the project area, and (ii) to enhance its long term asset  management plan and integrate climate change considerations.</narrative>
  </description>
